{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466670/extras/230974acdc51185ef781345ac35a78fc.avif?t=1755316807\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Akitoshi's stepsister, Midori, approaches him to ask for help with a tricky issue, so he steps up to the plate. It turns out his younger stepsister, Ichigo, is struggling to pass her exams and needs a lot of help studying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Aki shows up to tutor her, it becomes clear that she has no interest in her studies, and she just wants to have fun playing video games instead. It's up to Akitoshi to figure out how to motivate her to knuckle down and learn, but this may be more than a simple addiction...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466670/extras/14bd300531d865b81993894438560aed.avif?t=1755316807\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read this charming story about family bonds and the struggle to keep a problem student engaged with her coursework, and see how Akitoshi manages to get Ichigo under control so she can pass her exams in this visual novel from Soft Circle Courreges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466670/extras/2d7fb381443e87ca81c7babe891744c6.avif?t=1755316807\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466670/extras/3d534a4e424e6ea997318200b3203e31.avif?t=1755316807\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466670/extras/573a16f4bb18d5f2524b152402d6e0d9.avif?t=1755316807\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466670/extras/8b645290320eca72799ca5d496ffdbc7.avif?t=1755316807\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Read a Family Drama</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ichigo has a lot to learn, but no motivation to do so. How will Akitoshi convince her to focus on her studies? Read this charming visual novel to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard Visual Novel Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether using the skip function to zip through dialogue that you've already read, or close the text box to get a better look at the art, this game contains many of the expected visual novel mechanics used in the genre.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3466670?t=1755316807","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3466670?t=1755316807","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466670/a029f194528987cd0e734985a5c82787dec7d308/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755316807","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466670/a029f194528987cd0e734985a5c82787dec7d308/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755316807","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466670/extras/230974acdc51185ef781345ac35a78fc.avif?t=1755316807\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Akitoshi's stepsister, Midori, approaches him to ask for help with a tricky issue, so he steps up to the plate. It turns out his younger stepsister, Ichigo, is struggling to pass her exams and needs a lot of help studying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Aki shows up to tutor her, it becomes clear that she has no interest in her studies, and she just wants to have fun playing video games instead. It's up to Akitoshi to figure out how to motivate her to knuckle down and learn, but this may be more than a simple addiction...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466670/extras/14bd300531d865b81993894438560aed.avif?t=1755316807\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read this charming story about family bonds and the struggle to keep a problem student engaged with her coursework, and see how Akitoshi manages to get Ichigo under control so she can pass her exams in this visual novel from Soft Circle Courreges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466670/extras/2d7fb381443e87ca81c7babe891744c6.avif?t=1755316807\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466670/extras/3d534a4e424e6ea997318200b3203e31.avif?t=1755316807\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466670/extras/573a16f4bb18d5f2524b152402d6e0d9.avif?t=1755316807\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466670/extras/8b645290320eca72799ca5d496ffdbc7.avif?t=1755316807\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Read a Family Drama</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragr